  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "日本漢學",
    "sub_ename": "JAPANESE SINOLOGY",
    "describe_ch": "針對日本之主要漢學典藏機構及學術研究單位作深入之探討，藉以瞭解最新之學術動態及世界之漢學研究資訊。",
    "describe_eh": "The course will have an in-depth discussion upon major institutions that have collections on sinology and other academic research units, so as to allow the students to understand the latest academic orientations and information about researches on sinology.",
